    "excerpt": "This article is written to document a hobby that is quite unique compared to those around me, and to summarize a methodology for learning mathematics that suits me—or, at the very least, one that I am currently experimenting with. Readers can treat it purely as a story, while those interested may also glean some of my personal insights from it. As for the more substantive, technical aspects of my mathematical studies, I may continue to write about them in future articles, and I also plan to write a book review-style piece.",
