    "excerpt": "I'm late to this. It can be said that this year marked my gradual shift from pure mathematics to control and motion planning in my mathematical studies. From the second half of my junior year to the first half of my senior year, I distinctly felt myself absorbing knowledge like a sponge. I also thank @系统与控制 for organizing this question annually; I have gained a lot from these discussions over the years. Background: Let me first set the stage with some context. In 2023, during the first half of my junior year, I completed the course on Automatic Control Principles (classical control) according to the school's curriculum.",
